{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01608","headline":"杂曲歌辞 秦女休行 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 秦女休行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西门秦氏女，秀色如琼花。\n手挥白杨刀，清昼杀讐家。\n罗袖洒赤血，英声凌紫霞。\n直上西山去，关吏相邀遮。\n壻爲燕国王，身被诏狱加。\n犯刑若履虎，不畏落爪牙。\n素颈未及断，摧眉伏泥沙。\n金鸡忽放赦，大辟得宽赊。\n何慙聂政姊，万古共惊嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}